{
  "file": "module6",
  "page": 46,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        73.38239288330078,
        527.4071655273438,
        87.82539367675781
      ],
      "text": "These regimens should not be administered to people receiving protease inhibitors or nevirapine,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        87.38239288330078,
        527.4047241210938,
        101.82539367675781
      ],
      "text": "including for HIV-exposed infants on TPT. Rifampicin can decrease the concentrations of other",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        101.38239288330078,
        527.337646484375,
        115.82539367675781
      ],
      "text": "antiviral agents: atazanavir, darunavir, fosamprenavir, lopinavir, saquinavir and tipranavir. It should not",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.38239288330078,
        527.3707885742188,
        129.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "be used with saquinavir/ritonavir. No dose adjustment is required when rifampicin is co-administered",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        129.3824005126953,
        527.4277954101562,
        143.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "with efavirenz. The dose of dolutegravir (DTG) however needs to be increased to 50 mg twice daily",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        143.3824005126953,
        527.4003295898438,
        157.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "when given together with rifampicin, a dose that is usually well tolerated and gives equivalent efficacy",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        157.3824005126953,
        436.74749755859375,
        171.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "in viral suppression and recovery of CD4 cell count compared with efavirenz  . (22)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        185.3824005126953,
        527.4010620117188,
        199.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "The 3HP regimen can be administered to individuals receiving efavirenz-based antiretroviral regimens",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        199.3824005126953,
        527.4175415039062,
        213.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "without dose adjustment, according to a study of pharmacokinetics  . Administration of rifapentine  (84)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        213.3824005126953,
        527.4119873046875,
        227.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "with raltegravir was found to be safe and well tolerated  . A drug interaction study in healthy  (85)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        227.3824005126953,
        527.4266967773438,
        241.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "volunteers of DTG with once weekly HP reported toxicities in two of four participants  . However  (86)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        241.3824005126953,
        527.4032592773438,
        255.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "results released more recently from a Phase 1/2 trial of 3HP and DTG in adults with HIV reported good",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        255.3824005126953,
        527.341796875,
        269.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "tolerance and viral load suppression, no adverse events of Grade > 3 related to 3HP, and did not",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        269.38238525390625,
        459.923583984375,
        283.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "indicate that rifapentine reduced DTG levels sufficiently to require dose adjustment  . (87)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        297.38238525390625,
        527.4066772460938,
        311.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "Pregnant women living with HIV are at risk for TB, which can have severe consequences for both the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        311.38238525390625,
        527.4098510742188,
        325.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "mother and the fetus, with increased risk of maternal and infant death  . Pregnancy should not  (54)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        325.3824157714844,
        527.3902587890625,
        339.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "disqualify women living with HIV from receiving preventive treatment with medicines commonly used",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        339.3824157714844,
        527.3843994140625,
        353.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "to treat TB that are generally considered safe for use in pregnancy, such as isoniazid and rifampicin",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        353.3824157714844,
        527.4188232421875,
        367.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "(classified as Pregnancy Category C by the United States FDA  . There are limited data on  (55, 56)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        367.3824157714844,
        527.405517578125,
        381.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "the efficacy and safety of rifapentine during pregnancy. WHO currently recommends six months of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        381.3824157714844,
        527.4031982421875,
        395.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "isoniazid regimen as TPT for pregnant women living with HIV. A systematic review in 2019 identified",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        395.3824157714844,
        527.3823852539062,
        409.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "one RCT and three non-randomized comparative observational studies that provided data on adverse",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        409.3824157714844,
        527.3682861328125,
        423.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "pregnancy outcomes associated with the use of IPT among pregnant women living with HIV. While",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        423.3824157714844,
        527.4132690429688,
        437.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "the RCT showed a higher risk of adverse pregnancy outcomes among those who initiated IPT during",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        437.3824157714844,
        527.361572265625,
        451.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "pregnancy (Mantel-Haenszel OR stratified by gestational age, 1.51; 95% CI: 1.09–2.10), all three other",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        451.3824157714844,
        527.3330688476562,
        465.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "studies reported an overall OR < 1 suggesting the opposite (I2=80%, p=0.002). A meta-analysis from",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        465.3824157714844,
        527.379150390625,
        479.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "two observational studies that cited adjusted estimates and whose data could be pooled suggested",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        479.3824157714844,
        527.4161376953125,
        493.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "lower risk for composite adverse pregnancy outcomes (OR 0.40; 95% CI: 0.20–0.74)  . Based upon  (88)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        493.3824157714844,
        527.4010009765625,
        507.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "these findings the GDG concluded that there were insufficient grounds to change previous guidance",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        507.3824462890625,
        527.3682861328125,
        521.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "or to develop a separate recommendation for the use of IPT in pregnant women living with HIV. The",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        521.3824462890625,
        527.4551391601562,
        535.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "GDG considered that systematic deferral of IPT to the postpartum period would deprive people from",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        535.3824462890625,
        375.19647216796875,
        549.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "its protective effect at a point when they are more vulnerable to TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        563.3824462890625,
        320.18011474609375,
        577.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "Concurrent use of alcohol should be avoided with TPT.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        591.3823852539062,
        527.3848876953125,
        605.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "Further details on drug-drug interactions for TPT and TB treatment regimens are provided in the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        605.3823852539062,
        475.9521789550781,
        619.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": ". WHO operational handbook on tuberculosis. Module 6: tuberculosis and comorbidities (7)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        643.056396484375,
        354.91119384765625,
        662.6314086914062
      ],
      "text": "2.4.2\t TB infection prevention and control",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 15.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        675.3823852539062,
        527.391357421875,
        689.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "Comprehensive infection prevention and control (IPC) measures are essential to prevent TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        689.3823852539062,
        527.4169311523438,
        703.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "transmission in clinical settings that provide services for people living with HIV  . Whilst there are  (13)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        703.3823852539062,
        527.424560546875,
        717.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "no recommendations specifically for TB IPC in HIV care settings, the general TB IPC recommendations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        717.3823852539062,
        527.4398803710938,
        731.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "are relevant and are listed in Box 2.1 below. Also of relevance are the WHO  Guidelines on core",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        731.4154052734375,
        527.4736328125,
        745.6273803710938
      ],
      "text": "components of infection prevention and control programmes at the national and acute health care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        745.3823852539062,
        527.4102783203125,
        759.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": ", which cover IPC measures preventing transmission of infectious diseases that apply  facility level (89)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        759.3823852539062,
        187.239501953125,
        773.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "to all healthcare settings.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.8661003112793,
        801.2599487304688,
        51.10609817504883,
        811.763916015625
      ],
      "text": "28",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        801.2599487304688,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.763916015625
      ],
      "text": "WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.4364013671875,
        801.2599487304688,
        170.0603790283203,
        811.763916015625
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
